//! A declaration documented by the `doc` attribute rather than a doc comment
//! (after Rust's `#[doc]`, [Rust-reference], § Attributes): the attribute is
//! read into the report beside the declaration's verdict.
//!
//! - cites: [Rust-reference]
//!
//! [Rust-reference]: https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/ "The Rust Project, The Rust Reference"

// A greeting, its documentation given by the attribute alone.
@[ doc("Returns a fixed greeting.") ]
def greet = "hello";
